            "text": "По скон’чанїи же того єгда рече поп: „Блⷭви влдко“, въ той",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              128,
              1130,
              972,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-144-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 58,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-line-25",
            "text": "час ст҃ая цр҃квь [ста] ледяна, а ѡл’тарь ѡгнен. видѣв’ же цр҃ь и",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              128,
              1166,
              972,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-144-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 64,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-line-26",
            "text": "почꙋди сѧ. єгда рече поп: „Ѡ плавающих и пꙋтшествꙋющих“,",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              128,
              1203,
              972,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-144-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 56,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-line-27",
            "text": "тогда видѣ цр҃ь море и корабль плавающ. єгда рече поп: „Прⷭ-",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              128,
              1239,
              972,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-144-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 60,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-line-28",
            "text": "тоую чⷭтоую“, въ той час пристоупиша множство аг҃глъ подемше",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              128,
              1275,
              972,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-144-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 60,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-line-29",
            "text": "роуцѣ за вес миръ хрⷭтїанскїи мл҃яще Боу҃. єгда єреи сътвори",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              128,
              1312,
              972,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-144-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 60,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-line-30",
            "text": "выход, тогда Михаил ем попа за рꙋкоу и ведет, и Гаврїилъ за",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              128,
              1348,
              972,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-144-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 59,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-line-31",
            "text": "дрꙋгꙋю. єгда єреи начнет гл҃ти молт: „Бж҃е ст҃ыи и на ст҃ых",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              128,
              1384,
              972,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-144-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 59,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-line-32",
            "text": "почивая“, тогда множство аг҃глъ подымат апⷭлъ, реч Михаил:",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              128,
              1421,
              972,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-144-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 58,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-line-33",
            "text": "„Вон’мѣм!“ а Гаврїилъ реч: „Миръ всѣм!“ єгда же заиде попъ",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              128,
              1457,
              972,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-144-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 58,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-line-34",
            "text": "за трапезоу, начинает сѣдалище, гл҃єт: „Црю нбⷭныи ѹтѣшителю“,",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              128,
              1493,
              972,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-144-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 62,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-line-35",
            "text": "абїє пристоупиша два аг҃гла поемше єрея ведоша пред ст҃оую тра-",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              128,
              1530,
              972,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-144-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 63,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-line-36",
            "text": "пезоу. и начнет чⷭти єѵ҃лїє, в’ то время т҃. аг҃глъ възимают слова",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              128,
              1566,
              972,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-144-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 66,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
